playstyle = "The demiurge: rewrites the code, makes and corrupts cards; loud.
Cards in the hand rewritten into others, cards copied, a card corrupted to be stronger and louder (raising the trace each time it is played). High risk, a high trace. Suggested cards: one turning the hand into random cards a rarity higher, a Power copying the first card played each turn, loud cards that pay off big."
